WEBVTT

00:06.900 --> 00:10.230
Th-This really is really 
cramped for two people.

00:10.810 --> 00:12.100
It is.

00:12.850 --> 00:15.900
I have to say, those two...

00:15.900 --> 00:17.080
Yuri-tan.

00:17.080 --> 00:18.120
Masa-tan.

00:18.620 --> 00:19.640
Smooch!

00:21.190 --> 00:25.860
<i>We're trapped in a very 
sticky situation right now!</i>

00:27.430 --> 00:34.110
<i>Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh</i>

00:38.970 --> 00:43.730
My Tiny Senpai

00:44.480 --> 00:46.810
<i>We've got an emergency here</i>

00:47.230 --> 00:49.590
<i>Are you paying attention, me?</i>

00:49.980 --> 00:55.820
<i>There's someone other than me 
dancing around inside of my heart</i>

00:55.820 --> 00:58.070
<i>I want to talk to her</i>

00:58.570 --> 01:01.120
<i>I want to touch her</i>

01:01.120 --> 01:06.610
<i>Look, I get it, but for now try to pipe down</i>

01:07.120 --> 01:09.840
<i>What in the world am I doing?</i>

01:09.840 --> 01:12.590
<i>You're right next to me</i>

01:12.590 --> 01:18.840
<i>And this is the perfect chance...</i>

01:19.600 --> 01:20.420
<i>HONEY</i>

01:20.420 --> 01:25.130
<i>I'm trapped by that sweet rich taste</i>

01:25.130 --> 01:28.340
<i>And I don't think I can ever escape</i>

01:28.340 --> 01:30.840
<i>I may as well just sink into it</i>

01:30.840 --> 01:31.670
<i>HONEY</i>

01:31.670 --> 01:36.450
<i>It's another day in your dazzling presence</i>

01:36.660 --> 01:39.450
<i>We may never be 
on the same page with this love but</i>

01:39.450 --> 01:45.880
<i>Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh</i>

01:57.800 --> 02:02.300
#09 He Wants to Talk Privately...

01:57.920 --> 01:58.740
Smooch!

01:59.480 --> 02:02.620
<i>As for how we ended up here...</i>

02:04.750 --> 02:07.100
Meowtaro merchandise from 30 years ago?

02:07.100 --> 02:08.250
Right.

02:08.250 --> 02:13.700
It's for the upcoming Meowtaro 
30th anniversary exhibit.

02:14.220 --> 02:17.810
It should be in storage in the basement 
Could you go look for it?

02:17.810 --> 02:19.470
Sure thing.

02:19.470 --> 02:22.740
It might be a bit much to do on your own, 
so take Katase-san with you.

02:22.740 --> 02:25.740
Got it! We'll go find it.

02:25.740 --> 02:28.500
<b>General Affairs Office</b>

02:25.740 --> 02:28.500
<b>No Unauthorized Personnel Allowed</b>

02:27.030 --> 02:28.500
Did you find it?

02:29.730 --> 02:32.010
It's not over here.

02:33.640 --> 02:36.630
If it's from over 30 years ago, 
would it really...

02:37.640 --> 02:38.760
Did you find it?

02:38.760 --> 02:43.660
A Meowtaro pen case! 
I had one of these! This is so nostalgic!

02:43.660 --> 02:47.390
<i>This place might be a treasure trove 
to old-school Meowtaro fans!</i>

02:47.390 --> 02:51.320
Senpai, we should probably 
finish looking before the sun sets.

02:53.010 --> 02:55.400
I got a message from 
the manager on the office chat.

02:55.400 --> 02:57.900
Manager

02:55.400 --> 02:57.900
It should be on one of the shelves in the back.

02:55.740 --> 02:57.900
<i>It should be on one of the shelves in the back.{also what the text says, including the sender field}</i>

02:57.900 --> 02:59.180
The back...

03:01.360 --> 03:05.320
We've looked pretty much everywhere 
up front, so let's head farther back.

03:05.320 --> 03:06.410
Right.

03:06.410 --> 03:08.910
<b>Product Development</b>

03:06.410 --> 03:08.910
<b>Group 2</b>

03:10.600 --> 03:12.820
What're you grinning about?

03:13.670 --> 03:17.430
I feel like there's going to be 
a large helping of sugar served up.

03:22.090 --> 03:24.250
There's still so much stuff to look through.

03:24.680 --> 03:27.100
Where do we even start?

03:27.100 --> 03:28.430
Good question...

03:29.090 --> 03:32.440
For now, I'll start lowering 
the boxes on the upper shelves...

03:34.630 --> 03:36.160
No one's here, right?

03:36.160 --> 03:38.940
No one comes all the way down here.

03:38.940 --> 03:41.430
Shinozaki-san, look over here.

03:43.450 --> 03:45.660
But what if someone finds us?

03:45.660 --> 03:47.450
We'll deal with that if it happens...

03:47.450 --> 03:49.700
m 0 0 l 146 0 l 146 90 l 0 90

03:47.450 --> 03:49.700
<b>Public Relations

Ito Yuri</b>

03:47.450 --> 03:49.700
They're from PR. That's Ito-san and...

03:48.330 --> 03:49.700
I guess.

03:49.700 --> 03:51.000
Yeah.

03:49.700 --> 03:51.500
Yoshida-san.

03:49.700 --> 03:51.960
m 0 0 l 146 0 l 146 90 l 0 90

03:49.700 --> 03:51.960
<b>Public Relations

Yoshida Masao</b>

03:51.960 --> 03:54.320
What're they doing down here?

03:54.320 --> 03:55.610
Could it be?!

03:55.610 --> 03:56.460
Be what?

03:56.460 --> 03:58.960
Th-Th-This might be...

03:59.720 --> 04:00.710
What is it?

04:01.490 --> 04:02.820
Masa-tan!

04:03.910 --> 04:05.550
Yuri-tan!

04:05.550 --> 04:07.260
Smooch!

04:07.520 --> 04:08.430
<i>Wha—?!</i>

04:07.990 --> 04:09.660
<i>I knew it!</i>

04:08.430 --> 04:10.770
<i>A-An office romance?!</i>

04:10.770 --> 04:13.050
Gosh, Masa-tan, you're so bad.

04:13.050 --> 04:15.560
Only because you're so cute.

04:15.560 --> 04:17.790
But we're working!

04:17.790 --> 04:19.530
<i>I was about to say!</i>

04:19.950 --> 04:23.960
I'd heard rumors, but... I didn't think...

04:23.960 --> 04:27.040
Well, well, this is really something...

04:27.040 --> 04:28.530
<i>She's super staring!</i>

04:28.530 --> 04:31.370
I'm getting nervous being by the door...

04:31.370 --> 04:33.690
Does the thought of getting found excite you?

04:33.690 --> 04:34.960
Oh, you.

04:34.960 --> 04:37.170
<i>You've already been found, actually.</i>

04:37.170 --> 04:41.920
It's not that, but if we're going to 
have fun, I wanna move to the back.

04:45.550 --> 04:49.020
S-S-Senpai, they're coming this way!

04:47.610 --> 04:51.590
I-I know! Wh-Where do we hide?

05:05.350 --> 05:06.620
Yuri-tan.

05:06.620 --> 05:08.070
Masa-tan.

05:08.550 --> 05:11.080
Smooch!

05:12.960 --> 05:15.420
Well, it's good that 
we were able to hide, but....

05:16.440 --> 05:19.840
Th-This really is really 
cramped for two people.

05:20.550 --> 05:23.840
It is. I have to say, those two...

05:23.840 --> 05:27.470
Yuri-tan, Yuri-tan, oh, Yuri-tan!

05:23.840 --> 05:28.280
How long are they going to 
fool around like that?

05:27.470 --> 05:31.450
Masa-tan, Masa-tan, oh, Masa-tan!

05:29.090 --> 05:31.850
I hope they don't plan on 
doing anything weird...

05:31.450 --> 05:33.390
Yuri-tan Yuri-tan Yuri-tan!

05:31.850 --> 05:34.850
No... I can't imagine 
they would, in the office.

05:33.390 --> 05:34.850
Masa-tan Masa-tan Masa-tan!

05:35.320 --> 05:37.850
By the way... Senpai...

05:38.740 --> 05:44.970
Well... sorry if I smell sweaty or anything...

05:44.970 --> 05:46.360
It's okay.

05:46.360 --> 05:50.030
Since it's you... I don't mind.

05:50.630 --> 05:53.050
<i>Wh-What does that mean?!</i>

05:56.830 --> 06:01.590
<i>S-S-Senpai's ch-ch-chest...!</i>

06:01.900 --> 06:03.880
Sorry, Senpai...

06:03.880 --> 06:07.150
It's okay, we're safe, 
since I was able to catch...

06:12.100 --> 06:15.020
Sorry, sorry, sorry, sorry!

06:12.630 --> 06:15.020
It's okay, it's okay, it's okay, it's okay!

06:15.500 --> 06:18.640
<i>I can't take more of this! 
I need to get away soon...</i>

06:19.120 --> 06:21.060
Yuri-tan.

06:19.540 --> 06:22.650
<i>Somebody, chase those two off!</i>

06:21.060 --> 06:22.650
Masa-tan.

06:24.680 --> 06:27.030
<i>There has to be a way!</i>

06:30.570 --> 06:33.230
Senpai! The office chat!

06:33.230 --> 06:34.700
What about it?

06:34.700 --> 06:37.330
Use it to lure them away!

06:37.330 --> 06:43.340
Basement

06:38.120 --> 06:39.560
Come to the fifth floor.

06:39.560 --> 06:40.520
Oh, crap!

06:41.620 --> 06:43.340
Yay, yay!

06:43.760 --> 06:46.210
Senpai, hurry and contact them!

06:49.000 --> 06:50.430
What's wrong?

06:51.080 --> 06:53.470
I'm sorry, Shinozaki-san...

06:53.470 --> 06:55.990
When we hid in the locker before...

06:56.430 --> 06:59.670
I put my phone in my back pocket.

07:01.360 --> 07:04.080
Could you please get it?

07:04.080 --> 07:05.800
O-Okay.

07:07.170 --> 07:08.940
<i>Sh-She's asking me to...</i>

07:09.480 --> 07:12.200
<i>Reach around to h-her...</i>

07:12.520 --> 07:13.750
<i>Butt...</i>

07:14.200 --> 07:15.820
<i>My hands...</i>

07:20.580 --> 07:21.690
Can't reach.

07:24.080 --> 07:26.340
Is it okay if I move some?

07:26.860 --> 07:29.200
I'll be careful not to make any noise.

07:29.200 --> 07:30.340
Okay.

07:32.240 --> 07:34.220
Don't be embarrassed. Look at me.

07:34.220 --> 07:37.600
Come on, if you touch me like that...

07:37.600 --> 07:39.220
Not quite there...

07:39.220 --> 07:41.200
Yuri-tan.

07:41.200 --> 07:42.740
Masa-tan.

07:44.320 --> 07:45.550
Yuri-tan.

07:45.550 --> 07:47.110
Masa-tan!

07:47.110 --> 07:48.830
Yuri-tan!

07:48.830 --> 07:50.740
Masa-tan!

07:54.780 --> 07:57.740
Katase

07:54.780 --> 07:57.740
Emergency!
Please come to the fifth floor!

07:55.320 --> 07:56.160
Oh, crap!

07:56.160 --> 07:57.740
Katase-san's calling us!

07:57.740 --> 08:01.370
That's bad! We need to hurry 
or she'll realize we've been slacking!

08:14.120 --> 08:16.590
L-Looks like that worked.

08:16.590 --> 08:18.640
Y-Yeah.

08:20.270 --> 08:23.270
<b>Nice to meet you!
I'm Meowtaro
</b>Meow

08:20.820 --> 08:22.650
Wait, is that...

08:23.270 --> 08:26.020
The Meowtaro merchandise we were looking for!

08:26.020 --> 08:27.720
All right!

08:27.720 --> 08:29.840
I guess that's our silver lining!

08:29.840 --> 08:30.780
Yeah!

08:34.120 --> 08:36.530
W-We should hurry back, too.

08:36.890 --> 08:38.280
R-Right.

08:40.790 --> 08:42.570
<i>Twinge!</i>

08:43.790 --> 08:46.360
I sense something... powerful.

08:46.360 --> 08:47.480
Sorry?

08:47.080 --> 08:50.920
<b>Preciousness is detected
with one's sixth sense.{also sign}</b>

08:47.480 --> 08:50.920
<i>Preciousness is detected 
with one's sixth sense.</i>

09:17.480 --> 09:21.460
<i>I don't think I'm gonna 
be able to sleep tonight...</i>

09:26.550 --> 09:29.910
<i>My Tiny Senpai</i>.

09:31.780 --> 09:34.730
What's round and soft?

09:42.000 --> 09:45.140
<i>I ended up not getting any sleep...</i>

09:48.340 --> 09:51.420
<i>I didn't sleep at all last night.</i>

10:01.830 --> 10:05.950
<i>My subordinates have been 
acting weird since yesterday...</i>

10:06.400 --> 10:11.960
<i>Could it be there's been 
new developments of some kind?!</i>

10:18.020 --> 10:20.590
<i>I didn't get much sleep, again...</i>

10:20.590 --> 10:24.100
Li'l bro. It seems there's something 
new with you and Shiorin.

10:24.370 --> 10:27.100
What are you doing here on 
a workday, first thing in the morning?!

10:27.270 --> 10:37.610
Manager-san

10:27.270 --> 10:37.610
I sense lovey vibes between your brother
and Katase-san

10:27.270 --> 10:37.610
Say... what? I must
confirm at once

10:27.310 --> 10:30.350
Please do. I can handle things on
this end.

10:27.390 --> 10:37.610
Please do!

10:27.680 --> 10:30.200
Chihiro provided me with some updates.

10:30.200 --> 10:33.930
Manager did that?! And why are you 
sharing intel with my boss?!

10:33.930 --> 10:37.610
Also, "Chihiro"?! 
How close are you two anyway?!

10:38.760 --> 10:41.960
Seriously, there's nothing 
going on with Senpai.

10:41.960 --> 10:43.260
Sniff, sniff, sniff...

10:43.260 --> 10:44.120
What now?

10:44.640 --> 10:46.800
I can smell Shiorin on your suit...

10:46.800 --> 10:47.620
Wha?!

10:48.210 --> 10:52.810
For her fragrance to be 
so distinct on your clothing...

10:53.850 --> 10:57.830
I must assume you two 
were stuck together in a locker.

10:57.830 --> 10:59.550
<i>She's an ace detective!</i>

11:02.980 --> 11:04.170
<i>Ugh...</i>

11:04.960 --> 11:08.120
<i>I was trying to forget about it, 
but now because of her...</i>

11:08.900 --> 11:11.310
<i>It's in my head again.</i>

11:11.800 --> 11:15.900
<i>I still feel so anxious... 
maybe I should just...</i>

11:16.690 --> 11:19.190
<b>Product Development</b>

11:16.690 --> 11:19.190
<b>Group 2</b>

11:19.760 --> 11:23.040
<i>Today I... I'm gonna...</i>

11:23.040 --> 11:24.270
Shinozaki-san?

11:24.270 --> 11:25.030
Yes?!

11:25.030 --> 11:29.960
There's been a delivery. Would you mind 
accompanying me to general affairs?

11:29.960 --> 11:31.540
S-Sure.

11:32.800 --> 11:34.290
Is something wrong?

11:34.290 --> 11:36.090
N-No.

11:45.680 --> 11:48.440
<i>Senpai's not acting any differently.</i>

11:49.600 --> 11:52.410
<i>Maybe she just thinks of what 
happened as a workplace accident.</i>

11:53.840 --> 11:54.790
<i>But...</i>

11:55.820 --> 11:57.450
<i>if there's a chance...</i>

11:59.760 --> 12:01.980
<i>that she might feel the same way...</i>

12:08.060 --> 12:09.140
Senpai.

12:10.880 --> 12:13.960
May I have some of your time after work?

12:16.520 --> 12:19.290
There's something 
I'd like to discuss privately.

12:22.690 --> 12:24.490
Okay.

12:26.240 --> 12:29.220
Man, Meowtaro is honestly so cute.

12:29.220 --> 12:33.120
I know what you mean. The way 
he's so floppy is weirdly addictive.

12:33.120 --> 12:37.480
You can really see how he was able to be 
the company's big attraction for 30 years.

12:38.040 --> 12:40.730
<i>He wants to talk privately...</i>

12:41.400 --> 12:43.400
<i>I wonder what about?</i>

12:44.080 --> 12:45.740
<i>Maybe...</i>

12:46.400 --> 12:48.240
<i>maybe it's...</i>

12:51.090 --> 12:52.250
Shinozaki-san.

12:52.930 --> 12:54.570
What did you want to discuss?

12:58.930 --> 13:00.070
Senpai...

13:05.510 --> 13:08.460
I love you! Please, go out with me!

13:10.010 --> 13:13.520
<i>Th-Th-That's a little too big of a jump!</i>

13:13.520 --> 13:19.050
<i>I-I-It could be something else, like needing 
advice about work or personal advice, right?!</i>

13:19.770 --> 13:20.970
<i>But...</i>

13:22.070 --> 13:25.340
<i>if it really is that...</i>

13:26.760 --> 13:28.060
<i>I'd...</i>

13:29.540 --> 13:32.260
Oh, did you hear, Katase-san?

13:33.040 --> 13:36.540
Yoshida-san from PR is getting reassigned.

13:37.770 --> 13:39.290
Yoshida-san...?

13:39.290 --> 13:43.800
He was apparently fooling around 
with Ito-san while on the clock.

13:44.190 --> 13:46.600
There were a ton of witnesses, too.

13:46.600 --> 13:49.050
They were so into each other 
they probably didn't notice.

13:51.590 --> 13:55.560
I guess with office romances, 
someone will need to get reassigned, huh?

13:55.560 --> 14:00.310
I dunno. I think this is mostly 
about it affecting their work.

14:04.850 --> 14:06.360
<i>Reassignment...</i>

14:09.160 --> 14:11.670
It's kind of a shock, though.

14:11.450 --> 14:18.080
<b>The way
they were
before</b>

14:11.670 --> 14:15.880
I always thought those two 
were pretty cool and impressive.

14:11.930 --> 14:13.320
All right, let's move on!

14:13.320 --> 14:14.620
I've got it!

14:14.620 --> 14:16.060
I've got your back!

14:16.280 --> 14:17.530
But then...

14:17.370 --> 14:21.590
<b>The way
they are
now</b>

14:17.530 --> 14:18.960
Yuri-tan.

14:18.960 --> 14:20.380
Masa-tan!

14:20.380 --> 14:21.590
Yuri-tan...

14:22.040 --> 14:25.090
That is <i>such</i> a thing. Guys who
change the second they get a girlfriend.

14:25.600 --> 14:26.800
I know, right?

14:26.800 --> 14:28.650
Is it really so common?

14:28.650 --> 14:32.720
Oh, totally! They try to act cool 
in front of their friends...

14:33.360 --> 14:35.800
This? It's my chick.

14:35.800 --> 14:38.330
Cute? I dunno. Isn't she average?

14:39.570 --> 14:41.680
Or they try to white knight too hard.

14:41.680 --> 14:44.540
Isn't he staring at you too much?

14:44.540 --> 14:46.440
Next time he looks, 
I think I'll let him have it.

14:49.740 --> 14:52.590
Funnily enough, it's the serious, 
down-to-earth types

14:52.590 --> 14:54.650
who tend to go haywire 
when they get a girlfriend.

14:54.650 --> 14:58.500
And worst of all are the ones 
who go infantile once they start dating.

14:58.500 --> 14:59.640
Infantile?

14:59.640 --> 15:03.750
I guess they want to be babied? 
They want pats on the head and stuff.

15:04.360 --> 15:09.290
Shenpai! Sweepy! Gib headpats!

15:09.290 --> 15:13.580
Oh, if you insist. Good boy.

15:13.580 --> 15:15.760
<i>C-Cute...</i>

15:16.170 --> 15:19.040
I-I think that might be kind of nice...

15:19.040 --> 15:20.560
Isn't it cute?

15:20.560 --> 15:24.010
Come to think of it, you've always 
had shotacon vibes, Katase-san.

15:24.560 --> 15:28.570
I'm a... shota... shota... shota...

15:29.330 --> 15:36.330
I'm a... shota...

15:30.770 --> 15:33.180
What's your type, Hayakawa-san?

15:34.050 --> 15:36.330
M-Me...?

15:36.330 --> 15:38.570
Someone who does good work, who's kind,

15:38.570 --> 15:40.670
has a good head on their shoulders 
and is understanding of my hobbies,

15:40.670 --> 15:42.670
and always looks out for me...

15:42.670 --> 15:46.220
You're not gonna find a dreamboat like that 
in reality. Come back down to Earth.

15:48.310 --> 15:49.340
What a fun topic.

15:50.790 --> 15:52.330
Ito-san?

15:52.330 --> 15:55.330
It's true that women can make men change...

15:55.330 --> 15:56.260
But!

15:57.280 --> 15:59.780
Men can change women, too.

16:01.800 --> 16:02.890
Yuri-tan!

16:03.600 --> 16:06.110
So this is where you've been, Yuri-tan!

16:06.110 --> 16:07.860
Masa-tan!

16:07.860 --> 16:11.310
I'm so sorry for leaving you alone like that!

16:11.310 --> 16:15.870
It's okay! Absence makes the heart grow fonder.

16:16.270 --> 16:17.520
Isn't that right?!

16:17.520 --> 16:19.370
Yes, it certainly is!

16:19.990 --> 16:21.370
Yuri-tan.

16:22.050 --> 16:23.370
Masa-tan.

16:23.370 --> 16:27.280
Smoochie!

16:27.280 --> 16:28.720
They've gone totally, completely...

16:28.720 --> 16:29.880
...absolutely stupid.

16:29.900 --> 16:30.860
Masa-tan!

16:30.860 --> 16:33.070
Yuri-tan, I'll never let you go again!

16:31.250 --> 16:34.570
Totally, completely... absolutely stupid.

16:33.070 --> 16:35.890
Masa-tan, hold me tight!

16:39.800 --> 16:44.390
That display in there 
was a little too spicy for me.

16:46.550 --> 16:49.060
Is that what would happen?

16:50.280 --> 16:51.980
Acting like that...

16:52.650 --> 16:56.090
I'm so sorry I left you alone!

16:57.120 --> 17:00.660
It's okay! Absence makes the heart grow fonder!

17:01.040 --> 17:02.300
Isn't that right?

17:02.300 --> 17:04.160
Yeah! You're right!

17:04.880 --> 17:06.170
Shiorin.

17:06.770 --> 17:08.170
Takkun.

17:08.170 --> 17:10.170
Squeeze!

17:10.870 --> 17:14.010
Totally, completely... absolutely stupid.

17:21.250 --> 17:24.360
<i>I'm finally gonna tell Senpai...</i>

17:27.240 --> 17:30.360
<i>I can't run away! I need to brace myself!</i>

17:33.970 --> 17:35.280
Shinozaki-san.

17:39.120 --> 17:40.410
Senpai.

17:40.410 --> 17:44.410
Let's always be good coworkers, okay?

17:46.250 --> 17:49.170
<i>Because I don't want to be totally, 
completely, absolutely stupid.</i>

17:49.330 --> 17:53.200
I think having a relationship 
that stays the same is wonderful.

17:54.080 --> 17:57.580
<i>Because being totally, completely, 
absolutely stupid would be awful.</i>

17:59.680 --> 18:03.360
Sorry, I kind of talked over you there.

18:03.360 --> 18:06.180
What did you want to discuss, Shinozaki-san?

18:09.910 --> 18:10.900
I...

18:11.940 --> 18:14.440
I was going to say the same thing!

18:14.440 --> 18:16.060
That's great!

18:16.060 --> 18:18.450
We're on the same wavelength.

18:19.960 --> 18:21.190
We sure are.

18:21.950 --> 18:25.950
I was really worried you were having 
trouble with work or something!

18:25.950 --> 18:28.460
Are you going home now? 
Let's head to the station together.

18:28.460 --> 18:29.500
Yeah, sure.

18:43.290 --> 18:47.170
<i>Bleary-eyed and not fully awake from a dream</i>

18:47.170 --> 18:52.070
<i>I still can't bring myself 
to drink that bitter coffee</i>

18:52.630 --> 18:56.550
<i>So I sneakily toss in 
two pinches of a sweet secret</i>

18:56.550 --> 19:00.770
<i>And let it slowly spread throughout</i>

19:01.990 --> 19:05.730
<i>There's a local bakery 
that's only open sometimes</i>

19:05.730 --> 19:10.620
<i>Where I once had some toast that glittered</i>

19:11.280 --> 19:15.120
<i>What is it that makes it so satisfying?</i>

19:15.120 --> 19:19.290
<i>Almost like magic</i>

19:19.710 --> 19:24.370
<i>I find myself thinking about that kind of thing</i>

19:24.370 --> 19:29.980
<i>How the small things can be the most precious</i>

19:30.730 --> 19:34.770
<i>Deep inside my heart</i>

19:34.770 --> 19:39.170
<i>It's ever so bittersweet</i>

19:40.040 --> 19:44.090
<i>"Just being around you is enough"</i>

19:44.090 --> 19:48.110
<i>Becomes my mantra</i>

19:48.110 --> 19:50.400
<i>Baby like sugar</i>

19:57.510 --> 19:59.660
<i>Baby you're the sugar</i>

