20:08.470 --> 20:11.480
Episode 1

20:08.470 --> 20:11.480
Action! Shiorin

20:09.080 --> 20:11.480
"Action! Shiorin"!

20:11.880 --> 20:13.480
Big trouble, Shiorin!

20:13.800 --> 20:15.480
What's wrong, Yutakappi?

20:15.480 --> 20:17.950
Bad guys are attacking! 
The Demon Lord has come to town!

20:17.950 --> 20:19.400
Is that true?!

20:19.400 --> 20:20.970
Come on, Shiorin!

20:20.970 --> 20:21.740
Okay!

20:27.940 --> 20:29.370
That's enough!

20:30.920 --> 20:33.360
Stop this right now, Demon Lord!

20:33.360 --> 20:35.580
Magical Girl Shiorin is here to face you!

20:37.840 --> 20:40.090
So, you've come, Magical Girl...

20:44.590 --> 20:47.560
I'm the new Demon Lord, 
here to take over for my predecessor.

20:47.560 --> 20:50.100
It's a pleasure to be working with you!

20:51.760 --> 20:53.660
Thank you very much.

20:53.660 --> 20:54.410
Right.

20:56.080 --> 20:57.650
All right, here goes!

21:03.860 --> 21:06.090
I'm Magical Girl Shiorin.

21:06.090 --> 21:08.460
It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance.

21:08.870 --> 21:11.100
Oh, let me accept your card.

21:12.870 --> 21:15.630
I'll probably need a while 
to get used to everything, so...

21:15.630 --> 21:19.900
It's only my third year doing this, so I know 
that everyone has to start somewhere.

21:20.380 --> 21:21.430
Right.

21:28.130 --> 21:31.260
You can go ahead 
and put the business card away.

21:32.680 --> 21:34.270
R-Right...

21:34.270 --> 21:37.580
I know the timing can be kind of awkward.

21:37.580 --> 21:39.400
I appreciate your consideration.

