"Disaster! Shiorin"!{sub-title sign, + Episode 2}

21:48.530 --> 21:51.540
Episode 25

21:48.530 --> 21:51.540
Disaster! Shiorin

21:53.410 --> 21:54.790
This is bad.

21:54.790 --> 21:57.500
I'm so sorry, Professor Haya Kawa.

21:57.500 --> 21:59.880
You won't be able to transform now.

22:00.290 --> 22:02.990
With your transformation 
compact in this state...

22:02.990 --> 22:06.170
I was running and it fell out of my bag.

22:06.170 --> 22:07.680
Like a cell phone?!

22:07.680 --> 22:08.440
Da-ding!

22:09.880 --> 22:10.830
Enemy attack!

22:10.830 --> 22:12.600
At a time like this?!

22:12.600 --> 22:14.140
Come on, Shiorin!

22:14.140 --> 22:15.630
But...

22:15.630 --> 22:16.780
We've got no choice.

22:17.440 --> 22:20.400
It's older, but please, use it.

22:20.400 --> 22:22.440
Th-That is...

22:23.560 --> 22:25.850
There's no other way right now!

22:29.580 --> 22:31.000
Stop right there!

22:32.720 --> 22:36.580
So, you've come, Magical Giiiirl—

22:36.880 --> 22:39.200
Wh-Wh-What happened to you?! What is that?!

22:39.200 --> 22:41.210
There was a bit of an incident...

22:41.210 --> 22:43.710
so I'm using an older model 
of transformation compact...

22:44.000 --> 22:45.780
<i>The old days were hot!</i>

22:46.720 --> 22:49.840
Defeating you when you aren't 
at your best would mean nothing.

22:49.840 --> 22:51.720
I'll take my leave, for today.

22:51.720 --> 22:53.350
Thank you so much.

22:54.000 --> 22:55.530
I'm so, so sorry...

22:55.530 --> 22:59.030
I suppose this might be a job for me, 
as the previous Demon Lord...

22:59.850 --> 23:02.980
<b>To be continued!</b>

23:00.290 --> 23:01.540
To be continued!{also sign}
